    "html": "<p>An object is pulled by a horizontal rope along a rough horizontal surface during <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\"></span> s. The tension in the rope is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> N. A constant friction force of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> N opposing the motion also acts on the object. What is the rate of change of momentum with time of the object during these <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\"></span> s? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"140\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"700\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
